(
    title: "Fire Fly",
    description: Some("Marooned on a planet whose insect inhabitants have rebuilt themselves as murderous machines, the player pilots the Firefly across a run of single-screen gauntlets, blasting each foe with energy shots. The first task is to rescue the Pixy — the planet\'s last living creature, guarded by a killer bee — then survive escalating threats like a seed-spitting flaming pumpkin, demons and coiled serpents, with defeated enemies leaving treasures to collect."),
